      <p begin="02:02.280" end="02:04.360" ttm:agent="v1">깊이 더 파고들어</p>
      <p begin="02:04.360" end="02:07.080" ttm:agent="v1">My bullet goes 탕탕탕</p>
      <p begin="02:07.080" end="02:09.440" ttm:agent="v1">이건 La Vida Loca</p>
